The main-body evidence gap for the weather architectural attribution (Major weakness) and deferred ablations prevent a higher score, but the core contribution — multi-scale foundation model with statistically demonstrated attractor fidelity improvements on 9.3K systems — is real and well-evaluated. I anchor at **6.0**, consistent with the Pathformer poster range, reflecting a paper with a solid contribution that needs better evidential support for its two most prominent claims before becoming a clear accept.

