- *Claim support*: Fair — core claims well-supported; efficiency claims overstated.
- *Experimental soundness*: Good — six equations, four architectures, multiple settings; ablation of loss weighting is missing.
- *Clarity*: Fair — main results clear, but efficiency framing misleads, and unusual R² values unexplained.
