1. **Add a FDS-only ablation on ScanNet** (no normal prior) to Table 2. This is the single most important experiment missing from the paper. Even a partial version (2DGS+FDS vs. 2DGS, without any normal prior, on the 5 ScanNet scenes) would cleanly establish FDS's contribution on that dataset.
2. **Add DN-Splatter to Table 1 as an upper-bound reference**, clearly noting it uses sensor depth. This contextualizes FDS gains on the Mushroom benchmark.
3. **Add σ sensitivity and FDS start-iteration analysis** to the ablation section, even as a single additional row in Table 4 or a supplementary figure.
4. **Report per-scene standard deviations or error bars** on at least one dataset to characterize variability from random camera sampling.

